  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Say that you want to listen to a particular voice amongst a crowd, such as an announcer in a world with a lot of people and no in-world global voice feature. It would be useful to have an option to \"Isolate\" the voice, or lower the volume/mute all voices except for the user or users you specify, regardless of your distance from that user. Effectively, you could achieve this by muting or lowering the volume of every person in the instance, but in large groups, this would be extremely tedious.",
